Well, actually....

While looking around through the source code this weekend, it turns out that
the weight calculation formula looks something like:

	(strength + level) * 5

with the following conditionals:
	strengths greather than 18 are treated as 20 (18/01 and 25 both are 20)
	the maximum amount you can carry is 120

The stuff posted in the spoilers looks pretty much like the stuff in the 
source code which is #ifdef not HARD;  since HARD is normally defined, the
above formula is used instead.  (at least, that's what it looks like from
where I'm sitting).

As for hitting and damage bonuses, they're the same as 18/**.  25 *may* be
slightly better for dealing with webs and kicking;  I don't have the source
code here, so I can't check that right now.

